## Workflow

Ordered WorkflowStates + transitions with guards (none / requires-note / requires-role). An ops lead adds a waiting-on-legal state without an engineer; Run Workflow is the single writer that enforces it. Changing states after instances run on them is a migration: bump `version`, never rename keys.

```ts
import { Workflow } from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/service-desk/workflow';

@field workflow = linksTo(() => Workflow);
```

### Non-goals

No automation triggers (Automation Policy + commands own application); a `requires-role` guard compares role names the caller supplies; it is not an ACL.
